luci-app-apmond (1.0.1~be7a)
  * Add - version and last_version in one place (view/apmond/version.js), shown at the foot of each ApmonD page with the installed apmond version from apmond -v, unknown if apmond has no -v [bluewavenet]
  * Add - Access points: ULA and IPv4 address columns for each AP, the ULA links to that AP's Access points page in a new window, older apmond and mesh11sd APs show - with no link [bluewavenet]
  * Fix - Access points: this node's own ULA is plain text, not a link that opens this page again, found from node_ula and ap_mac_id in apmond status, read once when the page loads [bluewavenet]
  * Fix - Access points: wider Clients column and column titles wrap only between words, so Clients no longer shows as Client s [bluewavenet]

